[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
name = "expected_a1"
description = "Average hero at the act I boss (depth 3). ~290 XP from floors 1-2 (80% of the act I monsters) = level 6: 5 perks, spread over the common ones (no family awake yet). A Magic Katana (Sharp): at depth 1-2 about 1 found item in 4 is Magic. Leather armor. No rune yet (one per elite in 3, ~2-3 elites met, no forge guaranteed). Shrine after a few runs: Vitality 1, Might 1.
Level from the XP curve (PlayerDef: 20 x 1.45^(L-1) per level) and the XP lying on Normal floors (tools/balance economy measures it: table 'XP gathered before each act's boss'), assuming the player kills ~80% of an act I floor, 75% in act II, 65% in act III, 60% in act IV (the seal asks 70%, at most 50 kills), plus the bosses' XP. Perks: one per level up (level - 1), leaning to families (family_bias 1: a started family weighs double, so one family is awake by act II-III). Relics: one per boss slain. Gear: Magic/Rare weights from DungeonConfig > Loot at that depth (boss drops x5 quality; tools/balance economy: 'Rarity of found equipment'); runes: every boss drops one, elites 30%, so 3-4 runes by act II and a forge on ~30% of floors."
tags = PackedStringArray("expected")
act = 1
level = 6
weapon = ExtResource("3")
weapon_rarity = 1
weapon_affixes = PackedStringArray("sharp")
runes = PackedStringArray()
armors = Array[ExtResource("2")]([ExtResource("4")])
armor_rarities = PackedInt32Array(0)
armor_affixes = PackedStringArray("")
perks = {
"frenzy": 1,
"iron_skin": 1,
"precision": 1,
"strength": 1,
"vitality": 1
}
upgrades = {
"might": 1,
"vitality": 1
}
